<% content_for :title, "Carreiras - Busca Mais" %>

<%# Hero %>
<div class="text-white py-24 px-4 text-center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827 0%, #374151 100%)">
  <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Faça Parte do Time</p>
  <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Trabalhe no Busca Mais</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
    Buscamos pessoas curiosas, rigorosas e apaixonadas por contar histórias que importam.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">

  <%# Cultura %>
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-10">Por que trabalhar aqui?</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-16">
    <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Missão com propósito</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Seu trabalho tem impacto real. Ajudamos milhares de leitores a entender o mundo todos os dias.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Flexibilidade</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Modelo de trabalho híbrido e flexível, com respeito ao equilíbrio entre vida profissional e pessoal.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Desenvolvimento contínuo</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Incentivamos cursos, workshops e participação em eventos do setor.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-yellow-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Time diverso e inclusivo</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Valorizamos perspectivas diferentes. A diversidade torna nosso jornalismo mais rico e representativo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# Vagas %>
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm p-10 text-center mb-12">
    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gray-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
      <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gray-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Nenhuma vaga aberta no momento</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-6 max-w-md mx-auto">
      Não temos posições abertas agora, mas sempre buscamos talentos excepcionais. Envie seu currículo e entraremos em contato quando surgir uma oportunidade.
    </p>
    <%= link_to "Enviar Currículo Espontâneo", contato_path,
        class: "inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors" %>
  </div>

</div>
